<title>POLAND: Poland offers PLN 800 mln fixed bonds on May 7.</title>
<headline>Poland offers PLN 800 mln fixed bonds on May 7.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish finance ministry is offering 800 million zlotys worth of its 15-percent two-year bonds and 12-percent five-year bonds at a tender for institutional investors on May 7, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The bonds mature June 12, 1999 and June 12, 2002. The value date is May 12, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
